 "title": "Auditor — Hanson County, South Dakota",
 "text": "Auditor — Hanson County, South Dakota\nOctober 18, 2026\nHanson County, South Dakota\nHome\nAbout\nDepartments »\nAuditor\nResource Office\nEmergency Management\nEqualization\nExtension\nHighway\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff’s Office\nState’s Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeteran’s Office\nZoning Board\nCommissioners »\nCommission Agenda\nCommission Minutes\nCounty Ordinances\nBoards »\nZoning Board Minutes\nZoning Board Agendas\nTownship Board Members\nDrainage Board Agenda and Minutes\nEmployment\nAmbulance District Info.\nQuick Links\nYou are here: Home / Auditor\nAuditor\nAuditor: Lesa Trabing\nDeputy Auditor: Molly Pearson\nMailing Address: PO BOX 500 Alexandria SD 57311\nLocation: 720 5th St. Alexandria SD 57311\nPhone : 605-239-4714\nFax: 605-239-4296\nAuditor Email: lesat@hanson.co.sd.us\nOffice Hours : M-F 8:00AM-12:00PM and 12:30pm to 4:30PM\nAbout:\nThe County Auditor as the clerk of the County Commission is required to keep records of Commission proceedings. The Auditor’s fiscal duties include conducting a monthly verification of all bank balances and cash items in the County Treasurer’s Office and making a report of the same to the Commission, preparing warrants for all disbursements, publishing an annual report of the receipts and disbursements as well as the assets and liabilities of the County, and keeping inventory of County property. The Auditor also assists the Board with the annual budget, and calculates the annual levies.\n2020-2021 Annual Report\n2022-2023 Annual Report\nElection duties include voter registration, ballot preparation, appointment and training of election officials, canvassing and making abstracts of the votes casts, and issuing certificates of election.\nElection Information, Voter Registration, and Absentee Ballot Application:\nhttp://sdsos.gov/Elections/Default.aspx\nUpcoming Events\nPlanning and Zoning Hearing October 22, 2026 9:00 am – 10:00 am\nCounty Commission Meeting October 27, 2026 9:00 am – 12:00 pm\nGeneral Election November 3, 2026 7:00 am – 7:00 pm\nCounty Commission Meeting November 5, 2026 9:00 am – 12:00 pm\nClosed – Veterans Day November 11, 2026 8:00 am – 4:30 pm\nPlanning and Zoning November 19, 2026 9:00 am – 10:00 am\nCounty Commission Meeting November 24, 2026 9:00 am – 12:00 pm\nPlanning and Zoning Hearing December 17, 2026 9:00 am – 10:00 am\nReturn to top of page\nCopyright © 2026 on Genesis Framework · WordPress · Log in",
